[{"title":"孙季章无愧郑季奕徐斯远以仆留智门载酒见过坐中雪作三诗 其三","author":"赵蕃","text":"黄公亭上雪飞时，去岁相同此赋诗。\n邂逅出山还雪作，端如来赴去年期。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47310,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"孙季章无愧郑季奕徐斯远以仆留智门载酒见过坐中雪作三诗 其二","author":"赵蕃","text":"明知喜我出山来，占此僧窗共酒杯。\n重愧子云孤好事，绝胜安道不空回。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47311,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"安仁舣舟作","author":"赵蕃","text":"客路不知时节移，忽逢柳色已依依。\n无悰却数离家日，腊尽春回方始归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47312,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"安福道中见牛行陇亩间龁草而不食禾问之皆云谷成实则牛不复食矣","author":"赵蕃","text":"种得离离职尔劬，朝塍暮陇只生刍。\n丝毫无补家先实，愧杀纷纷小丈夫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47313,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戏呈卢老","author":"赵蕃","text":"晓起题诗砚欲冰，折梅还却步凌兢。\n不如纳被蒙头坐，坐到斋鱼始一兴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47314,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"成父居于普宁寺钟楼之下辟以为斋旧名坎止近易榜曰发深省衡州舅氏书之仆为赋四小诗以发深省斋为韵 其四","author":"赵蕃","text":"我有嗜睡癖，衾枕长与偕。\n晨昏要无失，曷日住君斋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47315,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"成父期以十八日至已而爽约","author":"赵蕃","text":"已是跫然误足音，更堪疏雨过平林。\n呼灯自举一卮酒，颠倒海涛寻破衾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47316,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"扬步","author":"赵蕃","text":"竟日人行绝，惟闻鸟语多。\n忽逢樵妇斧，更听牧儿歌。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47317,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"早饭龙堂寺","author":"赵蕃","text":"榉藤束缚竹为舆，野饭来寻僧所庐。\n茅屋正逢飞卷破，夜来风雨问何如。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47318,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"早晴闻啼鸟作","author":"赵蕃","text":"侧岭横峰面面同，雾空烟扫鸟声中。\n丁宁不用忧泥滑，珍重提壶屡劝翁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47319,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"早题","author":"赵蕃","text":"欲雨雨似止，为霜霜不成。\n山云解衣带，晓日挂铜钲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47320,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"曲江道中二首 其二","author":"赵蕃","text":"晓甑初炊早稻鲜，传呼与觅卖鱼船。\n可怜弹铗竟成恨，空对筠篮翠柳穿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47321,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"曲江道中二首 其一","author":"赵蕃","text":"舟下丰城十里馀，树烟鸥泊尽人居。\n是间欲画已不得，况有乱舟来捕鱼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47322,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"有怀成父","author":"赵蕃","text":"雪里同登我有诗，可怜同去阻同归。\n扶疏夏木浑如许，还想吾庐昼掩扉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47323,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"有怀施文叔寄之","author":"赵蕃","text":"超果寺前江抱村，数株乔木拥山门。\n先生得酒日成醉，不负春风野外昏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47324,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"有闻若管吹者意儿童为之问之乃鸟有名竹管者其声政如是云作三绝 其一","author":"赵蕃","text":"细听非笛复非芦，绝讶儿童底所呼。\n邂逅因之问何似，鸟鸣竹管自乌乌。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47325,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"有闻若管吹者意儿童为之问之乃鸟有名竹管者其声政如是云作三绝 其二","author":"赵蕃","text":"尽日閒窗运秃翁，自怜虚出管城封。\n不知尔更何为者，初听犹疑似足蛩。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47326,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"有闻若管吹者意儿童为之问之乃鸟有名竹管者其声政如是云作三绝 其三","author":"赵蕃","text":"蚕丝百箔旧曾闻，未说新丝价尔分。\n卒岁我无裘褐计，早知劝尔勿多云。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47327,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"朱村道中","author":"赵蕃","text":"绿竹人家近小塘，暮秋村酿熟村场。\n我行甚亟忘休歇，孤负木犀来往香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47328,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次王照邻韵二首 其二","author":"赵蕃","text":"虚憍徒恃井陉归，空壁争趋汉鼓旗。\n少不如人当自笑，况于心在力疲时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47329,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次王照邻韵二首 其一","author":"赵蕃","text":"长年未省厌长病，一暑方憎又一春。\n把卷颇思亲玉雪，出门无那苦埃尘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47330,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次张汉卿次房","author":"赵蕃","text":"平生几读右丞诗，未见贤孙归去迟。\n邂逅虽欣适吾愿，欲嗟人事好乖离。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47331,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵元衡两绝句 其一","author":"赵蕃","text":"倦游如此不嗟穷，醉眼犹能远送鸿。\n笑我老无湖海气，但思疆理事南东。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47332,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵元衡两绝句 其二","author":"赵蕃","text":"旧说诗坛不可攀，岂期于此得窥斑。\n茫茫世事催人别，数见犹期数日閒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47333,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵见可书示二绝并以送行 其二","author":"赵蕃","text":"诗材画笔本同姿，造物嗔人可怨饥。\n行橐君无叹悬磬，褐衣我亦欠絇丝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47334,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵见可书示二绝并以送行 其一","author":"赵蕃","text":"鹭立长滩本为饥，水深鱼没定奚为。\n何如烟雨青林畔，漠漠冥冥纵所之。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47335,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵刘子道机宜送酒","author":"赵蕃","text":"穷居谁肯念穷愁，况复凄凉雨似秋。\n疾置送诗仍饷酒，唤回落日在帘钩。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47336,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵刘寺簿二首 其二","author":"赵蕃","text":"草树扶疏书满斋，放窗灯火酒尊开。\n知公善诱盖前辈，不以见闻嗔去来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47337,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵刘寺簿二首 其一","author":"赵蕃","text":"山寺方同祭祀斋，忽惊茧纸一诗开。\n从今傥使亲馀论，愿戒应门许数来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47338,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵孙温叟求芍药二首 其二","author":"赵蕃","text":"送花政自从人乞，名品安能择是非。\n风雨连朝更工厄，便应红尽绿垂衣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47339,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵孙温叟求芍药二首 其一","author":"赵蕃","text":"邦人竞说江都胜，一朵千金尚恐非。\n自笑寒厅何自得，但馀阶砌长苔衣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47340,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵成父二首 其二","author":"赵蕃","text":"苦爱香醪似蜜甜，旧如杜老意拳拳。\n而今已作渊明止，别意欲醺醒重怜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47341,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵成父二首 其一","author":"赵蕃","text":"离居想见泊无娱，肯惮尻为上下舆。\n一见故怜无可语，要知终胜百函书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47342,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵伯元季奕送成父因以见寄五绝句 其一","author":"赵蕃","text":"几欲因人与问安，南来不见信州船。\n细思人世孰为别，明月相望同一天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47343,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵伯元季奕送成父因以见寄五绝句 其五","author":"赵蕃","text":"秋之为气已堪悲，那对掺掺旧补衣。\n为报君家小儿子，见时苍白莫言非。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47344,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵伯元季奕送成父因以见寄五绝句 其三","author":"赵蕃","text":"轻薄纷纷覆手空，两家交契百年中。\n要折青兰为远赠，同心更助服之衷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47345,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵伯元季奕送成父因以见寄五绝句 其二","author":"赵蕃","text":"句里兴怀快阁晴，独登长是费幽吟。\n有兴能来故差易，真愁回棹似山阴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47346,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵伯元季奕送成父因以见寄五绝句 其四","author":"赵蕃","text":"懒性作书非所便，忆君回首漫悠然。\n如闻有弟忽相觅，复道诗简见附船。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47347,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵李袁州绝句七首 其七","author":"赵蕃","text":"传闻起柂祇数日，引领白云犹在天。\n试问今谁满台阁，顾令是老落林泉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47348,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵李袁州绝句七首 其六","author":"赵蕃","text":"先生对宅投金濑，林壑要从东野分。\n便觅馀閒访吾舅，郊居赋就比凌云。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47349,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵李袁州绝句七首 其五","author":"赵蕃","text":"崧庵视我亦诸孙，已矣无从作九原。\n每听先生谈旧事，恍如秉烛对羌村。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47350,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵李袁州绝句七首 其四","author":"赵蕃","text":"先生句法从江夏，今代词人孰比肩。\n戏出小诗还会否，要收万斛作泓泉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47351,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵李袁州绝句七首 其三","author":"赵蕃","text":"山僧见客苦多惊，问我何时复此行。\n笑指壁间旧留句，继题曾辱老先生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47352,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵李袁州绝句七首 其二","author":"赵蕃","text":"路从迫窄因山转，喜见临歧释子庵。\n野茗柏香俱不恶，老松高竹更相参。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47353,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵李袁州绝句七首 其一","author":"赵蕃","text":"深林尽处背浮图，却悔舆篮不跨驴。\n珍重病僧留别语，晦庵去后亦来无。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47354,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵杨廷秀太和万安道中所寄七首 其七","author":"赵蕃","text":"莫为趋朝亟载脂，小令羸瘠长肤肌。\n帝城书疏旧不入，何有画图传荔枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47355,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵杨廷秀太和万安道中所寄七首 其六","author":"赵蕃","text":"几为年华叹物华，只今结束定还家。\n且看垂发江边树，未问长安一日花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47356,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵杨廷秀太和万安道中所寄七首 其五","author":"赵蕃","text":"先生力学自诚明，忠信今知蛮貊行。\n忆昔韩苏两仙伯，海成冬市况融晴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47357,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵杨廷秀太和万安道中所寄七首 其四","author":"赵蕃","text":"几欲裁诗托便风，苦惭别后欠新功。\n何时寄我广南作，压倒蕉黄荔子红。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47358,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵杨廷秀太和万安道中所寄七首 其三","author":"赵蕃","text":"旧说洛阳天地中，遂令北客病南风。\n只今政教通南粤，亦有大寒桑树红。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47359,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵杨廷秀太和万安道中所寄七首 其二","author":"赵蕃","text":"爱竹知人忆故山，食贫过午尚悬箪。\n长篇乞与小诗并，要似韩豪东野寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47360,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵杨廷秀太和万安道中所寄七首 其一","author":"赵蕃","text":"记得诗来半说花，不言长道苦风沙。\n知公不薄峤南使，政似昔人何以家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47361,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵季承闻田歌","author":"赵蕃","text":"布谷收声老尽秧，直缘避潦有今忙。\n歌呼嘹亮相欢杂，肯愧悠悠道上商。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47362,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵审知十三日四绝 其一","author":"赵蕃","text":"起看山月堕金盆，不料阴晴忽异门。\n我亦忍饥无复睡，绝怜甑倒又空樽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47363,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵审知十三日四绝 其四","author":"赵蕃","text":"连朝风雨已如秋，颇念林园柿栗收。\n谩说为生鄙计算，迩来盐米屡关忧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47364,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵审知十三日四绝 其二","author":"赵蕃","text":"咫尺相望得步过，忽然一雨阻山河。\n兴来径欲寻君去，数问溪流退几多。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47365,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵审知十三日四绝 其三","author":"赵蕃","text":"尺水真成起丈波，水南水北断经过。\n几思落笔题观涨，却恨诗材本不多。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47366,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵明叔送梅","author":"赵蕃","text":"长条忍使就斩伐，未信园翁珍此花。\n不然造物故料理，宜使飘零到我家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47367,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵秉文初九日过先垄 其二","author":"赵蕃","text":"耕道十年无九秋，无田长抱老农愁。\n因君动我束书感，君子恶居惟下流。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47368,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵秉文初九日过先垄 其一","author":"赵蕃","text":"剥啄敲门走梦周，夜来一雨润方收。\n徐郎示我郊行作，亟起讽之天定秋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47369,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵唐与文驿驰代简二绝句 其一","author":"赵蕃","text":"西去曾悲鸟道沿，东来又骇畏途鞭。\n如何一舸西江上，放溜乘风不用牵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47370,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵唐与文驿驰代简二绝句 其二","author":"赵蕃","text":"别日常多见愈亲，立谈已觉浣车尘。\n诗成两地嗟何及，明月相同影伴身。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47371,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵斯远二十六日三绝 其一","author":"赵蕃","text":"几欲收声效不鸣，恶同鸠辈管阴晴。\n有时触拨无穷景，又遣新诗取次成。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47372,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵斯远二十六日三绝 其三","author":"赵蕃","text":"春风去我孰能留，寒疾闻君顿已瘳。\n示以斜斜并整整，故知莫莫复休休。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47373,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵斯远十六日见简","author":"赵蕃","text":"忽来叩户新诗句，谓我将行可自疏。\n暂向沅湘采兰芷，扶疏终亦爱吾庐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47374,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵斯远见过三首 其三","author":"赵蕃","text":"四山一夜雨连明，岂料新晴顿得成。\n还往自兹宁可计，要须留句当题名。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47375,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵斯远见过三首 其二","author":"赵蕃","text":"语到蝉连自不休，吾曹岂亦固相求。\n望穷云谷云深处，共约骖羸向晚秋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47376,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵斯远见过三首 其一","author":"赵蕃","text":"形影相随一病身，穷愁忽忽又经春。\n为传车辙来何自，知是君存寂寞滨。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47377,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵斯远去秋八月十三日午睡既醒登山远望见怀 其二","author":"赵蕃","text":"数行书里两章诗，坐诵行哦昼屡移。\n赋当疏雨梧桐日，题就扶疏夏木时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47378,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵斯远去秋八月十三日午睡既醒登山远望见怀 其一","author":"赵蕃","text":"驱去复来仍此都，岂惟人诮鬼揶揄。\n顾防未免罹矰缴，却使高人赋雁奴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47379,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵斯远雨过彦章并属彦章二首 其二","author":"赵蕃","text":"老去篇章耻未穷，力耕岂谓岁能逢。\n切磋政尔须公等，户牖多开恐妄从。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47380,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵斯远雨过彦章并属彦章二首 其一","author":"赵蕃","text":"闻君访隐晓冲泥，竹尽林峦入稻畦。\n我亦有怀思并辙，不堪驴蹇更牛罢。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47381,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵衡州先生岁除前三日席上两绝句 其一","author":"赵蕃","text":"青山著雪倍增妍，青草掀泥浩莫边。\n便觉欣荣似春日，不知凋落是残年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47382,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵衡州先生岁除前三日席上两绝句 其二","author":"赵蕃","text":"非无旷野堪犁具，亦有清江可钓丝。\n为底崎岖衡岳路，良由寐寤竹斋时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47383,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵衡州先生除夕绝句","author":"赵蕃","text":"怀抱因公得好开，鬓须嗟我怕年来。\n敲门既辱频传句，守岁仍呼共引杯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47384,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"江天暮雪","author":"赵蕃","text":"超绝柳州句，粗疏郑谷诗。\n扁舟钓台下，曾见雪初时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":47385,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}}]